      "title": "Former cop Beau Lamarre-Condon argues self-defence in double murder trial citing struggle over gun",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/22/nsw-cop-beau-lamarre-condon-argues-self-defence-double-murder-trial-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Lamarre-Condon has pleaded not guilty to fatally shooting Jesse Baird, 26, and his partner, 29-year-old Luke Davies, with police service weapon in 2024</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/22/anthony-albanese-new-york-united-nations-intergenerational-report-coalition-one-nation-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p></p><p>A former police officer claims he killed two men in self-defence and began cleaning up the crime scene because he “panicked”, a Sydney court has heard.</p><p>Beau Lamarre-Condon, 31, has been accused of fatally shooting 26-year-old Jesse Baird and his partner, Luke Davies, 29, with a police service weapon at Baird’s Paddington home on 19 February 2024.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/22/nsw-cop-beau-lamarre-condon-argues-self-defence-double-murder-trial-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
